<mxCell id="sum" value="Flow — 1 User logs into the WebApp and clicks &quot;Open Dashboard&quot; · 2 WebApp calls the Looker API on GKE with the JWT · 3 Request enters the HUB and crosses HA VPN into Spoke 1 (Tooling) · 4 Looker API verifies the JWT with ID&amp;A through the Apigee Internal Proxy · 5 On success the Reverse Proxy routes via HUB (VPN + DNS peering) to Looker in Spoke 2 · 6 Dashboard rendered to the user. All login, auth and dashboard activity flows to Cloud Logging &amp; Monitoring." style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#FB8C00;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="740" width="1680" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
